      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCROLL UP (3) stuck on well last time to finish 1.5 lengths back in third (24.46) at Bendigo in a Maiden over 425m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Can measure up this time. DIRTY APOLLO (6) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten a nose at this track over 390m in 22.59. Can feature again. CALABRESE (1) eye-catching debut run after settling well back but winding up strongly into the frame when third (23.15) at this track over 390m. Boxed the fence this time. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. ROCKY CABANG (2) is by My Redeemer out of Stars And Lights making debut. Drawn well and should get his chance. Respect any moves in the market.",
